   "truncated": false,
   "text": "\r\n\r\nHannah Church, Hendersonville, TN.\nPlease do not build an underwater data center, there are endangered whale species and so many ecosystems that would be at risk. Whales are extremely susceptible to noise and disturbances, and data centers are notoriously loud and warm. \r\n\r\n"
  }
